{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3633fb1b1140ece1","name":"X-Wing Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-3633fb1b1140ece1","title":"X-Wing Starfighter","revision":18619,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:25:44Z","sha256":"903ac7597e289c21927bef14fcfda18b9379c57b4533821e835fddc4698f7b1b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18619","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=X-Wing%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3633fb1b1140ece1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Often hailed as the best Starfighter ever made, the T-65B X-Wing was developed in secret when the Incom Corporation began to support ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},". With impressive firepower for a ship of its size, sturdy shields, and even a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},", the X-Wing is as agile as an Imperial ",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Fighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Fighter","referenceId":"reference:726e84ae35ac767c"},", and far more versatile. It is equipped with a topside ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Socket"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Socket","referenceId":"reference:b6e7b59b72abbbc5"},", letting the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," plug in an ",{"tag":"a","children":["R2-Series Astromech Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/R2-Series_Astromech_Droid","referenceId":"reference:fec1452b3294defc"}," to handle targeting, damage control, and hyperspace calculation.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The X-Wing was designed following the formation of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},". Incom Corporation, suspected by the Empire of harboring Rebel sympathizers, was forced to halt production of non-Navy combat craft during an Imperial Security Bureau investigation into allegations of treason within the company. Members of the X-Wing design team were placed under arrest while they were interrogated by Imperial agents. As the Imperial investigation intensified, a group of Rebel commandos infiltrated the facility and rescued the X-Wing's senior design team, taking all T-65 plans and prototypes with them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Following the acquisition of the X-Wing's schematics, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," began to produce and test small numbers of the new Starfighter. Most of the initial trials were done under combat conditions. With its efficiency proven beyond a doubt, Rebel factories ramped up production of the T-65B. The craft soon became a favorite of Rebel fighter pilots, and it has been a staple of Rebel strategy ever since.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The T-65B is an excellent all-around Starfighter, capable of filling a number of roles with little or no modification. Not only is it maneuverable and easy to fly, it is equipped with modest shields, heavy weaponry, and an integrated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},". It is also a durable craft, capable of sustaining heavy damage while remaining operational. Were it not for this inherent sturdiness of design, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," could never hope to match the sheer number of Imperial fighters that are thrown against it.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each X-Wing is equipped with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Socket"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Socket","referenceId":"reference:b6e7b59b72abbbc5"}," that is capable of carrying an Astromech Droid. The Astromech Droid is an integral component of the X-Wing, and only adds to the Starfighter's versatility. Not only can the diminutive Droid see to minor repairs, it also uses its systems to help compute and store Hyperspace coordinates.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["X-Wing Starfighter Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +7; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 18 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze